# Current Project Priorities

Keep these three items visible in planning, scoping, and tradeoff discussions unless the user explicitly changes priorities:

1. Alerts System
2. Workspace systems
3. Tightening of the admin and role-based system

Guidance:

- Treat these as user-level product priorities unless the user explicitly says something is admin-level.
- When proposing or sequencing work, note whether it supports one of these three priorities.
- If a task does not clearly support one of these priorities, do not force it; just keep the priorities visible.
